{"id":15148247111,"name":"The Long Drive","desc":"📄The Long Drive is an adventure racing simulator with an apocalyptic theme and elements of survival in the harsh conditions of the surrounding world.\n\n📄E - Interaction.\n📄Shift - Run.\n📄F - Use headlights.\n📄R - Reload.\n📄Backspace - Throw away an item.\n📄V - Release the mouse.\n📄Q - Turn on the music.\n📄H - Honk.\n📄X - Turn signals.\n\n💎The peculiarity of the game is that the world can change completely randomly, which will not allow you to anticipate or avoid a dangerous situation.\n\n✅Avoid the Svintusov and get to Almaty with loot boxes!\n\n📊You should always be prepared for unexpected turns of events, strive to develop the main character, and also not forget about the main means of transportation.\n\n📝Many features were taken from the original The Long Drive game, but we tried to change most of the mechanics.","path":"/game/15148247111-the-long-drive","slug":"15148247111-the-long-drive","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9c29508daaa5f45bf7a2ae1e635c8d02/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/79f866f686501457889c02c333d80de1/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":18,"visitor":104436437,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-05-14T11:40:47.497Z","creator":{"name":"korazinas","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"The-Long-Drive-script-13011","_id":"66434dbf2626a8de7ff56b2b","title":"Good script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78376","gameId":15148247111,"name":"The Long Drive","imageUrl":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/79f866f686501457889c02c333d80de1/500/280/Image/Jpeg","placeId":15148247111},"features":"this is not mine.\nthe creator is on the script.\nit has fullbright feature which is real good and speed up and also tp to car and fly car.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Scripterbacon/Test-Script/main/The%20Long%20Drive.Lua\"))()","owner":{"_i